     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there any reason <i><b>not</b></i> to change the <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/RStan-Getting-Started#install-rstan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/RStan-Getting-Started%23install-rstan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466619970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18ttjZoikzSodqsL_ugxos\">instructions for installing Rstan </a>to include byte-compilation as:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><pre><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;rstan&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;source&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> INSTALL_opts </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;--byte-compile&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></pre></div></code></div><br>Thanks,<br><br>Avi<br><br></div>"
