    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>Not that I know of, but it will make very little difference to the execution speed. The rstan R package has almost no R code that does computations since all the sampling, monitoring, etc. is done with C++ code in Stan.<br><br>Ben<br> <br><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div></div></div>"
